1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:02,630
- So how was work today?
- Busy.

2
00:00:02,801 --> 00:00:07,181
(Girl:)I removed an appendix, a gall bladder
and about a foot and a half of bowel.

3
00:00:08,348 --> 00:00:10,018
I'm hoping that was three different guys.

4
00:00:10,183 --> 00:00:11,353
[CHUCKLES]

5
00:00:12,102 --> 00:00:13,932
(Girl:)No, just the one.

6
00:00:15,271 --> 00:00:16,941
(Girl:)He didn't make it.

7
00:00:18,525 --> 00:00:19,855
(Girl:)So how was your day?

8
00:00:20,944 --> 00:00:24,534
(Leonard:)You know, I'm a physicist,
so I thought about stuff.

9
00:00:26,116 --> 00:00:29,536
- That's it?
- I wrote some of it down.

10
00:00:29,703 --> 00:00:30,873
[LAUGHS]

11
00:00:31,037 --> 00:00:32,747
- Are you done eating?
- Yeah.

12
00:00:32,914 --> 00:00:34,584
(Girl:)Oh, good.

13
00:00:37,711 --> 00:00:41,301
(Leonard:)If I knew you were waiting,
I would have swallowed that lasagna whole.

14
00:00:41,464 --> 00:00:42,964
[PHONE RINGS]

15
00:00:43,717 --> 00:00:45,797
STEPHANIE [ON RECORDING]:
You've reached Dr. Stephanie Barnett.

16
00:00:45,969 --> 00:00:47,009
(Phone rings. Answering machine:)Leave a message.

17
00:00:47,178 --> 00:00:48,218
[PHONE BEEPS]

18
00:00:48,388 --> 00:00:50,308
HOWARD:
Hey, Steph, it's me again, Howard.

19
00:00:50,473 --> 00:00:53,893
(Howard(voice):)If you're free Friday, maybe we could
have something to eat at my place.

20
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:58,020
(Howard(voice):)My mom cooks a hell of a brisket.

